   961 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
   962 				; Set_Menu_Demo_Attrs - poke palette_id<<4 into the expanded attribute map's
   963 				; (MENU_BANNER_MAP_VRAM) cell covering each of the demo overlay's 8 squares,
   964 				; for all MENU_DEMO_SQUARE rows each square spans.  Plain CPU loop (no
   965 				; blitter - a small, one-time boot fixup; every other cell stays palette 0
   966 				; from the boot-time clear).  MENU_BANNER_MAP_VRAM is exactly bank-
   967 				; aligned, so a running byte offset from its start splits cleanly into a
   968 				; bank number (offset's upper nibbles) and a window address (offset's low
   969 				; 12 bits) - recomputed every byte, since the covered rows straddle the
   970 				; $35xxx/$36xxx bank boundary partway through (row 25 already crosses it).
   971 				; Called once from start:.
