  1010 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  1011 				; Selector_DrawStatus - repaint row 20 for the current Sel_Index, and row 0's
  1012 				; image counter (Selector_DrawCount).  "Nfo: " is always shown at col 0; cols
  1013 				; 5-79 hold the name for a *.V1K row whose slot was filled from IMAGES.LST,
  1014 				; or are cleared (75 spaces) for a directory / ".." row or an empty list.
  1015 				; Pure VRAM read - no file I/O.
