  1597 				; Sel_Key_Down/Up/Left/Right - each validates and clamps the move, then hands
  1598 				; the new index to Sel_Nav_Apply.  Because the list is one flat, row-major
  1599 				; array, Left/Right wrapping across a row boundary needs no extra logic -
  1600 				; it's just Sel_Index +/- 1.
