  1937 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  1938 				; Sel_Key_Quit - open the "Q" quit-confirm overlay: stash the covered
  1939 				; rectangle, frame it, show the prompt, and hand control to Quit_Confirm_Keys
  1940 				; (UI_Mode 5).  Q is only ever recognized here - every other screen ignores
  1941 				; it - so quitting always passes through this confirmation.
  1942 				;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
